### Feature Customers — DELETE físico / lógico (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: npm run dev:token -- admin  (o POST /api/sesion/login desde ISS-15)
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### Borrado lógico (status = inactive)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrado físico
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
